abstract: >
  Recall is an offline Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) assistant powered by
  Microsoft Foundry Local. It provides hybrid retrieval, evidence validation,
  citation-aware answer generation, incremental indexing, and local document
  search through a Streamlit interface.

